24)----------------------SubqueryAlias: cd2
25)------------------------TableScan: customer_demographics projection=[cd_demo_sk]
26)------------------Filter: customer_address.ca_state IN ([Utf8View("MS"), Utf8View("IN"), Utf8View("ND"), Utf8View("OK"), Utf8View("NM"), Utf8View("VA"), Utf8View("MS")])
27)--------------------TableScan: customer_address projection=[ca_address_sk, ca_county, ca_state, ca_country], partial_filters=[customer_address.ca_state IN ([Utf8View("MS"), Utf8View("IN"), Utf8View("ND"), Utf8View("OK"), Utf8View("NM"), Utf8View("VA"), Utf8View("MS")])]
28)--------------Projection: date_dim.d_date_sk
29)----------------Filter: date_dim.d_year = Int64(1998)
30)------------------TableScan: date_dim projection=[d_date_sk, d_year], partial_filters=[date_dim.d_year = Int64(1998)]
31)----------TableScan: item projection=[i_item_sk, i_item_id]
